                          USAGE REQUIREMENTS & RESTRICTIONS
================================================================================

By using this Software, you agree to the following:

1. ATTRIBUTION: You MUST cite the original authors of SHAW, ESMDA, and ILUES
   in any publication, presentation, or report resulting from the use of this
   Software. Failure to provide proper attribution constitutes a violation of
   academic integrity and this license.

2. NON-COMMERCIAL USE: This Software is provided for academic research and
   educational purposes. Commercial use is permitted under the MIT License,
   but users must ensure compliance with the licensing terms of all third-party
   components, especially the SHAW model.

3. NO COPYRIGHT CLAIMS: You MUST NOT register copyright, patent, or other
   intellectual property rights over the SHAW model, ESMDA algorithm, or
   ILUES algorithm. You MUST NOT claim authorship of these components.

4. SHAW MODEL DISTRIBUTION: You MUST NOT redistribute the SHAW model source
   code or executable without permission from USDA-ARS. Obtain the SHAW model
   directly from the official USDA-ARS source.

5. EDUCATIONAL USE ONLY: The ESMDA and ILUES algorithm implementations in this
   Software are provided for educational and research purposes. Users should
   refer to the original publications for the authoritative descriptions of
   these algorithms.

6. PYTHON DEPENDENCIES: This Software depends on third-party Python packages
   (numpy, scipy, pandas, matplotlib, pyecharts, tqdm), each subject to their
   own licenses. Users must comply with the terms of these licenses.

